{
    "_doc": "Business Hotel (Docs/Locations/Plan_ResidentialDistricts.md 3), reached from the shopping street (no world door of its own). Works like a home that anyone may check into by paying: a guest holds a child of membertype_jp_hotel_guest (one per room type, each with its own Daily membershipFee and room ID prefix) through JoinHandler_HotelGuest - a character with a home gets the hotel as TEMPORARY home (their home stays, they sleep in the owned hotel room since temp homes come first), one without a home becomes a PERMANENT resident (user rule, ResidenceUtility.CheckIntoHotel). NPCs are put here by the AssignHotelGuest event result with the same rule. Check-out = LeaveHandler_HotelGuest (temp-home guests only; a permanent resident leaves only when an event sets a new home) or automatically when the daily fee fails (Hotel_FeeFailed -> CheckOutHotelGuest). Guest rooms are private (bed) and members only (requireFactionMembership); lobby and restaurant are public. Meals: the restaurant's furniture_marker_getmeal at mealHours (non-player faction - one bento in stock is never used up, hospital pattern). World door (725,225), floorExitID hotel_lobby.",
